<p>Increases your light and darkness resistance penetration by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">24%, 34%, 42%, 49%, 55%</acronym> for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns, and reduces the cooldown of all Celestial skills by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 5, 6.</acronym></p><p>The resistance penetration will increase with your Cunning.</p>